 to the Modules section.</span></span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Enable access to the MTD IT module.</span></span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The screen will display the number of MTD IT licences remaining.</span></span></li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Click Save.</span></span></li></ol><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please refer to GIF for step 3 and 4.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9247660538/original/Rms-fO3qHzK20UETwbTJ_vbV2-GwtPY3Fg.gif?1777287512\" style=\"width: 514px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9247660538\"></span></span></p><hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><h4 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>Step 5: Confirm the Client Appears in the MTD IT Module</strong></span></span></h4><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><sp